---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="From Game Player to Game Maker | Video Game Palooza"
      description="Turn an interest in gaming into a first hands-on technology project with Video Game Palooza. Explore the Tornado Spinner, retro games that support our mission, and technology-training pathways.">
  <section class="section" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#160b2e,#0a1226 62%);text-align:center">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:900px">
      <span class="eyebrow">From Game Player to Game Maker</span>
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.6rem);line-height:1.12;margin:.35em 0">They already love gaming.<br/>Help them discover what they can build.</h1>
      <p style="color:#dce6fb;font-size:1.2rem;line-height:1.75;max-width:780px;margin:0 auto">
        Gaming can be a doorway into coding, electronics, design, cybersecurity and other technology careers.
        Video Game Palooza helps learners take the first step: understand how a game works, build or configure
        something real, test it and explain what they learned.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-row" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:26px">
        <a class="btn hope" data-cta="tornado_guide" href="https://tornadospinner.com/support/">Try the Tornado Project</a>
        <a class="btn" data-cta="shop_retro" href="https://shop.videogamepalooza.org/collections/all-video-games">Shop Retro Games</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" data-cta="explore_training" href="https://hopetrainingacademy.org/">Explore Technology Training</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:940px">
      <div style="text-align:center;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 30px">
        <span class="eyebrow">A First Hands-On Project</span>
        <h2>See how an arcade control becomes computer input</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--mut);font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.75">
          The Tornado Spinner is a physical arcade controller. Its switch bank selects the mouse axis,
          corrects direction and tunes response. The setup guide turns those controls into a small,
          concrete technology exercise: make one change, reconnect, test and observe the result.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="arcadefeat">
        <div>
          <h3>Configure. Test. Explain.</h3>
          <ol style="color:var(--mut);line-height:1.8">
            <li>Choose whether the spinner controls the X or Y axis.</li>
            <li>Test the direction and reverse it when needed.</li>
            <li>Combine switch values to tune the response.</li>
            <li>Describe what changed and why.</li>
          </ol>
          <p><a class="btn" data-cta="tornado_guide_detail" href="https://tornadospinner.com/support/">Open the illustrated setup guide</a></p>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:center">
          <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0742/1391/6860/files/product.png?v=1787429821"
               alt="Tornado Spinner arcade controller" loading="lazy"
               style="max-width:100%;max-height:430px;object-fit:contain" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0b1631,#0a1226)">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:920px;text-align:center">
      <span class="eyebrow">Play With Purpose</span>
      <h2>Choose the next step that fits</h2>
      <div class="give" style="margin-top:26px;text-align:left">
        <div class="givecard">
          <h3>Build with Tornado</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--mut)">Use the illustrated guide to configure the controller, then purchase one for an arcade or learning project.</p>
          <p><a data-cta="buy_tornado" href="https://store.hopetrainingacademy.org/products/tornado-spinner-arcade-spinner-controller">View Tornado Spinner →</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="givecard">
          <h3>Shop retro games</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--mut)">Find original games and collectibles. Every purchase supports Video Game Palooza's nonprofit mission.</p>
          <p><a data-cta="shop_retro_card" href="https://shop.videogamepalooza.org/collections/all-video-games">Browse the retro store →</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="givecard">
          <h3>Learn technology</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--mut)">Explore technology-training pathways through Hope Training Academy.</p>
          <p><a data-cta="training_card" href="https://hopetrainingacademy.org/">Explore training →</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p style="color:var(--mut);margin-top:24px">100% of net proceeds from Tornado Spinner sales support Video Game Palooza's nonprofit technology-training mission.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script is:inline>
  (function () {
    var carried = [
      'gclid', 'gbraid', 'wbraid',
      'utm_source', 'utm_medium', 'utm_campaign', 'utm_term', 'utm_content'
    ];
    var incoming = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);

    document.querySelectorAll('a[data-cta]').forEach(function (link) {
      var cta = link.getAttribute('data-cta') || 'unknown';
      var destination;
      try {
        destination = new URL(link.href, window.location.href);
      } catch (error) {
        return;
      }

      carried.forEach(function (name) {
        if (incoming.has(name) && !destination.searchParams.has(name)) {
          destination.searchParams.set(name, incoming.get(name));
        }
      });

      if (!destination.searchParams.has('utm_source')) {
        destination.searchParams.set('utm_source', 'videogamepalooza.org');
      }
      if (!destination.searchParams.has('utm_medium')) {
        destination.searchParams.set('utm_medium', 'referral');
      }
      if (!destination.searchParams.has('utm_campaign')) {
        destination.searchParams.set('utm_campaign', 'vgp_game_to_tech_story');
      }
      destination.searchParams.set('utm_content', cta);
      destination.searchParams.set('vgp_cta', cta);
      link.href = destination.toString();

      link.addEventListener('click', function () {
        var eventData = {
          cta_id: cta,
          destination_host: destination.hostname,
          destination_path: destination.pathname,
          source_path: window.location.pathname
        };
        try {
          (window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || []).push(
            Object.assign({event: 'vgp_story_cta'}, eventData)
          );
        } catch (error) {}
        try {
          if (window.gtag) window.gtag('event', 'vgp_story_cta', eventData);
        } catch (error) {}
      });
    });
  }());
  </script>
</Base>
